    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.10 Lifespan",
      "source_hash": 14174763411295303290,
      "context_hash": 4204562299734290488,
      "translation": "3.10 수명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:49.007916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.10 received bugfix updates approximately every 2 months for approximately 18 months.",
      "source_hash": 14809244684168618115,
      "context_hash": 9743850758442874703,
      "translation": "3.10에는 약 18개월 동안 약 2개월마다 버그 수정 업데이트가 제공되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:49.007916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Some time after the release of 3.11.0 final, the 11th and final 3.10 bugfix update was released.",
      "source_hash": 13275486672479018824,
      "context_hash": 16169560964525726057,
      "translation": "3.11.0 최종 릴리스 후 얼마 지나지 않아 3.10의 11번째이자 마지막 버그 수정 업데이트가 출시되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:49.007917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "After that, it is expected that security updates (source only) will be released until 5 years after the release of 3.10 final, so until approximately October 2026.",
      "source_hash": 8474458561573244994,
      "context_hash": 15585527576049142475,
      "translation": "그 후에는 3.10 최종 릴리스 후 5년이 되는 시점, 즉 대략 2026년 10월까지 보안 업데이트(소스 전용)가 출시될 것으로 예상됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:49.007919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
